# Files that live in /site but are NOT part of the website.
#
# The assets directory is "./", so without this list every one of these would
# be downloadable from the live domain. The Worker script and the deploy config
# are build inputs, not pages.
worker.js
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
README-GODADDY-UPLOAD.txt
.dev.vars

# Local working files. These never exist in a GitHub-triggered build, because
# that starts from a clean checkout, and .gitignore keeps them out of the repo.
# They DO exist when someone runs `npx wrangler deploy` from their own machine,
# and wrangler uploads from the filesystem rather than from git, so without
# these lines a hand deploy publishes the local dev state. It did exactly that
# on 2026-11-03 before this was added.
.wrangler
node_modules
*.map
